  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx4 - 6x2 - 1 = 0\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nIf a - (1/a) = t\n\nSo,\n\na² + (1/a)² = t² + 2\n\na³ - (1/a)3 = t³ + 3(t)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx4 - 6x2 - 1 = 0\n\n⇒ x² - 6 - 1/x2 = 0 [Dividing both side by x2]\n\n⇒ x2 - 1/x2 = 6\n\nNow,\n\n(x6 - x-6) - 3 (x4 + x-4) = {x6 - (1/x)⁶} - 3{x4 + (1/x)4}\n\n⇒ {(x²)3 - (1/x²)³} - 3{(x²)² + (1/x2)2}\n\n⇒ {6³ + 3(6)} - 3{6² + 2}\n\n⇒ {216 + 18} - 3{36 + 2}\n\n⇒ 234 - 3 × 38\n\n⇒ 234 - 114\n\n⇒ 120\n\n**∴ Required answer is 120.**",
